# Victor, Valgavoth's Seneschal counts how many times its Eerie ability has resolved this turn. Victor comes
# down on turn 1; on turn 5 four enchantments enter in one turn: the first resolution surveils 2 (Bot1 puts Hill Giant and
# Lightning Bolt into the graveyard), the second makes Bot2 discard a card (the Ornithopter among the Islands Bot2 is
# holding), the third puts a creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield untapped under Bot1's control (Bot1 takes Bot2's
# Ornithopter, not its own Hill Giant, and may not take the Lightning Bolt: not a creature card), and the fourth does nothing.
# (Black Lotus sacrificed itself, so Bot1 graveyard holds three cards after the surveil.) Mana: Mox Pearl pays Authority of the Consuls; Black Lotus pays the three green enchantments.

[Bot1 Deck]
Victor, Valgavoth's Seneschal
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Exploration
Fastbond
Hardened Scales
Authority of the Consuls
Hill Giant
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

